                     <title ref="LIT0049IHA#s25IHA"/>
                     <incipit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#1v">-1v</locus>بِسم اللهِ الرَّحْمَنِ الرَّحِيْمِ قَدْ اَفْلَحَ المُؤْمِنُوْنَ الذِّيْنَ هُمْ فِيْ صَلَاتِهِمْ خَاشِعُوْنَ وَالذِّيْنَهُم اللَّغْوِ مُعْرِضُوْنَ</incipit>
                     <explicit xml:lang="ar">
                        <locus target="#16v">-16v</locus>وَجَعَلْنَا بَعْضَكُمْ لِبَعْضٍ فِتَةً اَتَصْبِرُوْنَ وَكَان رَبُّكَ بَصِيْراً<note>بَصِيْراً : fatḥa and sukūn on yā’</note>
                     </explicit>
                     <note>23:1-25:20. No titles of suras. Eleven lines to a page. At the end of the ǧuz' (15v-16r), thirteen lines to a page of a more compact script. Words left incomplete at the end of a line, rewritten in full on the next line. Late catchwords (3v, 9v, only). Deletion (15v). The manuscript is damaged by humidity.</note>
                     <note/>
